<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Exogen Inc EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Exogen Inc EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it cut its 1996 earnings per share view for Exogen Inc by $0.01 to a loss of $0.99;</p>
<p>-- cut its 1997 EPS view by $0.45 to a loss of $1.10;</p>
<p>-- cut its 1998 EPS view by $0.90 to a loss of $0.65;</p>
<p>-- cut its 1999 EPS view by $0.99 to a loss of $0.10.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 7/16 at 4-7/16</p>
</text>
